SQL Data Analysis
=================

Self-contained SQL + SQLite + Pandas project.

Demonstrates:

    - relational tables
    - INNER JOIN
    - GROUP BY
    - aggregation
    - CTEs
    - window functions
    - ranking
    - Pandas analysis
    - CSV export

The initial dataset is synthetic so that the repository
runs immediately.

Later, replace the sample-data section with a real dataset.

Requirements
------------
pip install pandas

Run
---
